{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/extras/111__2_.png?t=1738625896\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kingdom of Peace</strong> is an addictive adventure game <strong>created by one person</strong> (<strong>specifically by a 15-year-old teenager who makes games in his free time</strong>) set in a brutal and at the same time beautiful medieval world. Take on the role of Rac\u0142aw, a hero forced to escape from the cruelty of war, to find shelter and start a new life in a more peaceful land. Your journey is a story of courage, sacrifice and the fight to survive in a harsh reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>An epic adventure in two lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience Rac\u0142aw's dramatic journey through two medieval lands. Fleeing from the war, the hero finds himself in a new kingdom, where he will have to build a new life and deal with the everyday challenges of being the manager of his own settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/extras/2__8_.jpg?t=1738625896\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Construction and development of the settlement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After reaching the new land, Rac\u0142aw will have the chance to found his own settlement. Build houses, mills, bakeries and other structures that will help create a self-sustaining community. Manage resources, take care of the inhabitants and prepare the settlement for unforeseen difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/extras/3__3_.jpg?t=1738625896\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf5e <strong>Realistic needs and survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunger and thirst will be a daily challenge. Search for food, water and shelter while protecting yourself and others from the dangers of life in the medieval world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/extras/6__1_.jpg?t=1738625896\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Discover the beauty and brutality of the medieval world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse landscapes, from picturesque villages and peaceful fields to dangerous forests and ruined settlements that provide a hiding place for sinister bandits. Each place hides its secrets and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/extras/8__1_.jpg?t=1738625896\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Rich plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about Rac\u0142aw's history and his fight for a better tomorrow. Meet colorful characters, solve problems and discover how the war affected people in both kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/extras/10__1_.jpg?t=1738625896\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Kingdom of Peace</strong> is the story of a man facing the cruelty of war and trying to build a future in a world full of challenges. Will Rac\u0142aw find peace and a place to call home? <strong>See for yourself ;)</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The son of a warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/68e66b07a0afa38a6f810b3a35283a31fec97ca8.jpg"},{"name":"Wolves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/df55947658e661be80e65bc247d3b95505a9c27d.jpg"},{"name":"Where is the traveler?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/2a6c6ab574e9d2468fe11f9ced0102f1f66cb9b6.jpg"},{"name":"Second chance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/7e0f9a4f44fa420fba471ea51cfa3b44c076a83e.jpg"},{"name":"Time for a real adventure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/b0e15eef4f1440b0dcf732f9b7b0c552ae55e0a7.jpg"},{"name":"Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/2862ebb422f14d179aebd8b486abe303038d5361.jpg"},{"name":"Training makes perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/f2695240789446d28b99b1927f734f573153001b.jpg"},{"name":"Knight on a white horse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/5dc1d931823f406af0e05a3c238dacfd704e575f.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh bread","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/79f4e307377cef330dbe237339d04e8ba3f6dec8.jpg"},{"name":"Eat fruits and vegetables!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2904920/91c3d8c3219077ddafeab724ee988c8a529d6e30.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2904920?t=1738625896","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738625896","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/957391e64a9e1e8e96fbfe059a67c62a7cc8e700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738625896","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904920/957391e64a9e1e8e96fbfe059a67c62a7cc8e700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738625896","categories":[{"descr